name yagusylo
category Package
revision 29803
shortdesc A symbol loader
relocated 1
longdesc The name is by way of being an acronym for "Yet Another Grand
longdesc Unified Symbols Loader"... The package allows the user to
longdesc access a symbol without loading the package that usually
longdesc provides it; this has the advantage of avoiding the name
longdesc clashes that so commonly trouble those who load
longdesc symbol-packages.
